█ Features:
█
████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
█
█  ╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
█  ║ 🎯 CORE FEATURES                                                          ║
█  ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
█
█  - ANTI RECOIL: Automatically compensates weapon recoil with profile support.
█    🔧 3 Profiles with independent vertical/horizontal settings
█    🔧 Multiple activation modes (Always/ADS/Fire)
█    🔧 Dynamic and legacy anti-recoil modes
█    🔧 Weapon detection system with ADT patterns
█
█  - AA ROCKET: Advanced aim assist with 18 unique movement patterns.
█    🎯 18 SHAPES: Circular, Tall Oval, Wide Oval, Spiral, Helix, DNA,
█                  Double Spiral, Hexa Walk, Infinity, JShake, Sway,
█                  Box Sweep, Pulse, Freeze Flick, Reverse Loop, Orbit,
█                  Rose, Left-Right
█    🎯 DUAL STICK SUPPORT: Full shape selection for both Left and Right sticks
█    🎯 ADS MODE: Separate settings for hip-fire and ADS aiming
█    🎯 OUTSIDE FOCUS MODE: ADS-only aim assist activation
█
█  ╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
█  ║ 🎮 GAMEPLAY ENHANCEMENTS                                                  ║
█  ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
█
█  - AUTO RUN: Enables automatic running with configurable sprint settings.
█
█  - HOLD BREATH: Automatically holds breath when aiming down sights.
█    🔧 Breath Timer (s): Duration for holding breath (0-4 seconds)
█    🔧 Time Before (s): Delay before activation (0-20 seconds)
█    🔧 Cooldown Timer (ms): Cooldown period between activations
█
█  - AUTO PING: Automatically ping enemies when aiming.
█    🔧 Trigger Timer (s): Delay before activation (0-10 seconds)
█
█  - SLIDE CANCEL: Stop sliding after configurable delay.
█    🔧 Cancel Delay (ms): Delay before canceling slide (10-120ms)
█
█  - ANTI AFK: Prevents inactivity disconnections automatically.
█
█  - RAPID FIRE: Configurable rapid fire with auto-detection.
█    🔧 Shots Per Second: Customizable fire rate
█    🔧 Hold Time: Duration of button press
█
█  - SPAM BUTTON (YY): Weapon swap spam for faster animations.
█    🔧 Spam Delay: Configurable timing between swaps
█    🔧 Min Hold Time: Minimum press duration
█    🔧 Trigger Button: Customizable activation button
█
█  - BUNNY HOP: Automatic jump spam for advanced movement.
█    🔧 Profile-specific activation for different weapons
█
█  ╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
█  ║ ⚙️  ADVANCED SETTINGS                                                      ║
█  ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
█
█  - NO RUMBLE: Disables controller vibrations for better focus.
█  - INVERTED AXIS: Invert Y-axis for customized control scheme.
█  - SILENT MOD: Vibration-based detection for automatic mod deactivation.
█    🔧 Deactivates Anti-Recoil & AA when vibration detected
█  - BUTTON LAYOUTS: 22 pre-configured controller button layouts
█  - QUICK TOGGLE: Fast rapid fire & anti-recoil toggle via quick combos
█  - PROFILE SWITCHING: Quick weapon profile changes during gameplay
█  - VEHICLE MODE: Special mode for vehicle combat
█
█  ╔═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
█  ║ 📺 OLED INTERFACE                                                          ║
█  ╚═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
█
█  - FULL MENU SYSTEM: Complete OLED configuration interface
█  - PROFILE DISPLAY: Visual profile indicator during gameplay
█  - SETTINGS EDITOR: Real-time adjustment of all parameters
█  - STATUS DISPLAY: Active mods and current settings overview
█  - SCREEN SAVER: Automatic display protection with animated intro
█  - WEAPON DETECTION DISPLAY: Real-time ADT pattern detection feedback
█
█████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████████
